# Base URL of services/api (§3.3), e.g. https://ef-api-xxxxx.a.run.app
# Deliberately NOT NEXT_PUBLIC_* — it's read at request time by the server
# Route Handlers in app/api/config and app/api/proxy, never inlined into the
# client bundle at build time. Unset or empty -> the in-memory mock data
# layer (lib/store.ts) is used instead; every screen keeps working.
#
# In Cloud Run this can be changed on the existing image with:
#   gcloud run services update ef-web --set-env-vars=API_BASE_URL=... --region=us-central1
# which rolls a new revision in seconds — no rebuild needed to repoint the
# app at a different backend or to fall back to mock mid-demo (§6).
API_BASE_URL=
